[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2440134490","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98588#issuecomment-2440134490","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98588","id":2440134490,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RcX9a","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-27T18:48:44Z","updated_at":"2024-10-27T18:48:44Z","body":"This should really be a [proposal](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals) IMO as it is a suggested change in behavior, RPCs are by their very definition *remote* procedure calls","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2440134490/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2440137674","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98588#issuecomment-2440137674","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98588","id":2440137674,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RcYvK","user":{"login":"greenfox1505","id":1642297,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDIyOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1642297?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505","html_url":"https://github.com/greenfox1505","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-27T19:00:18Z","updated_at":"2024-10-27T19:00:18Z","body":"I promise most people who are making multiplayer games have hit this confusion several times. Anyone who doesn't strictly make dedicated server games will absolutely be using RPCs locally. Being persnikity about \"remote\" vs local in RPC use isn't really how RPCs are used to make games.\r\n\r\nI did consider making it a proposal, but IMHO it's confusing enough to be a bug. At the very least, it needs to be a \"harder\" error/crash, not just an error message. It's easy to miss. I've personally wasted a lot of time not realizing I needed `\"call_local\"`.\r\n\r\nWith networking, security should be the top priority, but when there isn't a security risk, IMHO we should trust the developer. IMHO, this is a bug.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2440137674/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2440154283","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98588#issuecomment-2440154283","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98588","id":2440154283,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Rccyr","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-27T19:54:18Z","updated_at":"2024-10-27T19:54:18Z","body":"I'm not being \"persnikity\", please be constructive instead of calling names\r\n\r\nI'll leave this open but I'd say this change to intended and documented behavior is absolutely proposal material, it is a far better place to discuss changes of this kind, undesired behaviour isn't necessarily a bug, especially when it's by design and has dedicated features to handle it","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2440154283/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2440160057","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98588#issuecomment-2440160057","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98588","id":2440160057,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RceM5","user":{"login":"greenfox1505","id":1642297,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDIyOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1642297?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505","html_url":"https://github.com/greenfox1505","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-27T20:12:47Z","updated_at":"2024-10-27T20:12:47Z","body":"Understandable. I can create a proposal if that's necessary. At minimum I think the error message sound be \"louder\". RPCs called out of proper context should be a show-stopping error in dev builds.\r\n\r\nNot to be pedantic (but Imma be pedantic), \"persnikity\" is an adjective, not a \"name\". Sorry if I caused offense regardless.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2440160057/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2440161468","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98588#issuecomment-2440161468","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98588","id":2440161468,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Rcei8","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-27T20:17:56Z","updated_at":"2024-10-27T20:33:36Z","body":"Making general errors stop execution is a dedicated issue, there's a proposal for it somewhere but can't find it right now, so other than crashing or similar we can't make errors in the engine side stop execution, that's an unfortunate limitation\r\n\r\nNote also that `rpc` is just a thin wrapper around `rpc_id` so having it behave differently on `rpc` from `rpc_id` would be a bit complicated\r\n\r\nFor the pedanticism, to \"call names\" is to describe someone in derogative ways, though I might be confusing it with general descriptions of using pejorative or derogative phrasing to describe someone's responses, but apology accepted!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2440161468/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2440163284","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98588#issuecomment-2440163284","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98588","id":2440163284,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Rce_U","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-27T20:24:32Z","updated_at":"2024-10-27T20:30:07Z","body":"To clarify about bugs, generally we consider things bugs if they are:\r\n* Behavior that is either against the intended functionality, or has unintended consequences\r\n* Intended behavior that is practically useless in actual use cases, even if the behavior is not the result of unintended consequences (i.e. a mismatch between *expected* and *actual* use cases)\r\n\r\nSince in this case you can adjust and use it as intended, with local calling, using configuration, and it works for the general functionality, I would consider this not a bug but a proposed change of features, I hope that makes the distinction clearer\r\n\r\nI'd argue that this suggestion will be more likely to be accepted if presented as an improvement suggestion than as a bug, avoiding fighting up-hill over classification","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2440163284/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2440435687","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98588#issuecomment-2440435687","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98588","id":2440435687,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Rdhfn","user":{"login":"a-johnston","id":9058941,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTg5NDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9058941?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston","html_url":"https://github.com/a-johnston","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-28T02:57:03Z","updated_at":"2024-10-28T02:57:03Z","body":"I might be misunderstanding but IMHO this would be bad default behavior `// call local: [..] // - if broadcast to all peers except not this peer`\r\n\r\nAt least in my project, which is more or less traditional server-client style, state updates are generally not handled the same way on the host as they are when propagated to client peers. I agree that the error message could be improved, potentially explicitly calling out the rpc option to use for the call to be allowed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2440435687/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2440451777","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98588#issuecomment-2440451777","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98588","id":2440451777,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RdlbB","user":{"login":"greenfox1505","id":1642297,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDIyOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1642297?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505","html_url":"https://github.com/greenfox1505","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenfox1505/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-28T03:10:08Z","updated_at":"2024-10-28T03:10:08Z","body":"I'm not suggesting `.rpc(` change. If your server is not also a player, this wouldn't change much for you.\r\n\r\nIn my games, I need certain things to only run on the server. If a player is also the server, and they fire a weapon at a monster owned by the server (who is him), I call a `rpc_id(get_multiplayer_authority(),...` to make this object run on the owner. This is a pretty common occurrence, make sure this code runs on the owner of this object.\r\n\r\nMaybe the real answer is `rpc_owner(` as a true feature add, ignore \"call_local\" behaviour and just run this on the owner (if authority is valid). \r\n\r\n\r\nFor me, `\"call_local\"` seem to be used most for broadcasts to everyone, including local. Not for 1:1 communication.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2440451777/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2440488198","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98588#issuecomment-2440488198","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98588","id":2440488198,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RduUG","user":{"login":"a-johnston","id":9058941,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTg5NDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9058941?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston","html_url":"https://github.com/a-johnston","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-28T03:43:28Z","updated_at":"2024-10-28T03:43:28Z","body":"I understand what you're saying but I'm not sure why it would be better to have an option handled differently between rpc/rpc_id vs requiring the method's rpc annotation be correct for its intended use (although again I agree the error message could be improved to point people towards making this change). I find it beneficial distinguishing between normal method invocations and rpc invocations for a few reasons, so even if this change was made I would not be taking advantage of it. Regardless though, feel free to make a proposal and I can follow up there.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2440488198/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]